      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "Differentiate term by term: 4(-2x^(-3)) + 2(3x^2) + 0. The exponent -2 brings down a negative factor.",
         "mathjson": [
            "Add",
            [
               "Multiply",
               6,
